[INPUT]
- language: Korean
- output_size: 1024x1024

[1. PURPOSE]
Create a square promotional sale card for a 24-hour unmanned stationery shop.
Highlight back-to-school bundles with notebooks, pencil cases, stickers, and workbooks.

[2. OBJECT & COMPOSITION]
- Centered square card layout with a cheerful retail flyer composition.
- Top header contains {매장명}, {상단 배지}, and {운영 안내} in compact hierarchy.
- Main hero title {메인 제목} dominates the upper-middle with {서브 문구} underneath.
- Product bundle illustrations are arranged in a lively 2x2 grid around the center, using {일러스트 스타일}.
- Use rounded coupon shapes, label stickers, and playful stationery motifs from {장식 요소}.
- Background uses {배경색}, accents use {포인트색} and {보조색}, text uses {텍스트색}.
- Keep safe margins of 7%, generous spacing, and a clear CTA block at the bottom.

[3. CORE STRUCTURE]
1) Header / top — small pill badge with {상단 배지}, shop name {매장명} on the left, {운영 안내} on the right, and {행사 기간} below in a thin rounded bar.
2) Hero area — large bold Korean headline {메인 제목}, subheadline {서브 문구}, and an oversized starburst badge {할인 배지} overlapping the title corner.
3) Mid section — centered bundle label {준비물 묶음명}; four illustrated product cards in a 2x2 grid: {상품명 1} with {상품 설명 1}, {상품명 2} with {상품 설명 2}, {상품명 3} with {상품 설명 3}, {상품명 4} with {상품 설명 4}.
4) Bottom / CTA — wide rounded button containing {CTA 문구}, price/value strip {가격 문구}, and small footer note {하단 안내}.

[4. STYLE RULES]
- Typography: bold rounded Korean sans for headline, clean Korean sans for body, handwritten marker accent for badge text.
- Palette: {배경색} base, {포인트색} primary sale accents, {보조색} secondary highlight blocks, {텍스트색} for legibility.
- Product cards use white paper-like panels with {카드 모서리}, soft shadows, thin pastel outlines, and sticker-style labels.
- Overall {레이아웃 분위기}: bright, friendly, busy enough to feel like a school supply sale but still readable.
- Use cute stationery icons, dotted lines, tape strips, memo paper shapes, and small sparkle marks as supporting decorations.

[5. VISUAL STYLE]
- Camera / lens: flat graphic poster render, orthographic product illustration, crisp vector-like edges.
- Lighting: soft even studio lighting simulated through gentle shadows and subtle paper texture.
- Color grade: bright pastel retail palette, high readability, warm white highlights, saturated sale accents.

[6. MOOD]
Cheerful Korean neighborhood shop promotion with playful back-to-school energy.

[7. CRITICAL]
- Korean text accuracy: {매장명}
- Korean text accuracy: {상단 배지}
- Korean text accuracy: {운영 안내}
- Korean text accuracy: {행사 기간}
