studio:prompts3:ours-1471.content:
[INPUT]
- language: Korean
- output_size: 1024x1536

[1. PURPOSE]
Create a practical vertical safety checklist card for local secondhand meetups.
Designed as a clean Korean infographic for sharing on social media or community chats.

[2. OBJECT & COMPOSITION]
- Centered vertical card with rounded rectangle canvas, generous margins, and clear top-to-bottom reading flow.
- Use {배경색} as the full background and {카드 배경색} for the main card surface.
- Place {일러스트 주제} as a friendly small hero illustration under the title, not overpowering the text.
- Organize information into three stacked checklist sections with compact icons, soft dividers, and ample spacing.
- Apply {레이아웃 느낌} with {포인트색} highlights and {보조색} secondary accents.

[3. CORE STRUCTURE]
1) Header / top — Set {카드 제목} in large bold Korean sans, centered. Add {카드 부제} beneath in smaller medium weight. Place {날짜} as a small pill label near the top-right.
2) Hero area — Add a simple friendly illustration of {일러스트 주제}, with warm orange accents, local neighborhood map pin, handshake, and shield motif.
3) Mid section — Create three rounded info blocks: first block titled {섹션1 제목} with {장소 수칙 1}, {장소 수칙 2}, {장소 수칙 3}; second block titled {섹션2 제목} with {계좌 수칙 1}, {계좌 수칙 2}, {계좌 수칙 3}; third block titled {섹션3 제목} with checkbox rows {체크항목 1}, {체크항목 2}, {체크항목 3}, {체크항목 4}.
4) Bottom / CTA — Add a calm safety reminder strip with {하단 문구}, centered, using {포인트색} background and white text.

[4. STYLE RULES]
- Typography: {제목 글꼴} for title, {본문 글꼴} for section titles and body, high readability on mobile.
- Color palette: {배경색}, {카드 배경색}, {포인트색}, {보조색}, dark charcoal text #222222, muted gray body text #555555.
- Icons: {아이콘 스타일}, consistent line weight, small circular icon badges at the left of each section title.
- Borders: 24px rounded card corners, 18px rounded section blocks, subtle 1px border #EFE3D2, soft shadow 0 16px 40px rgba(86,60,35,0.12).
- Text hierarchy: title 58-68px, subtitle 28-34px, section titles 32-38px, body items 25-30px, footer 28-32px.

[5. VISUAL STYLE]
- Camera / lens: flat-lay editorial infographic render, orthographic front view, crisp vector-like elements.
- Lighting: soft studio illumination with gentle paper texture, no harsh contrast.
- Color grade: warm community notice style, clean cream background, orange safety accents, friendly and trustworthy.

[6. MOOD]
Helpful neighborhood safety guide, warm, practical, trustworthy, and easy to scan.

[7. CRITICAL]
- Korean text accuracy: {카드 제목}
- Korean text accuracy: {카드 부제}
- Korean text accuracy: {날짜}
- Korean text accuracy: {섹션1 제목}
- Korean text accuracy: {장소 수칙 1}
- Korean text accuracy: {장소 수칙 2}
- Korean text accuracy: {장소 수칙 3}
- Korean text accuracy: {섹션2 제목}
- Korean text accuracy: {계좌 수칙 1}
- Korean text accuracy: {계좌 수칙 2}
- Korean text accuracy: {계좌 수칙 3}
- Korean text accuracy: {섹션3 제목}
- Korean text accuracy: {체크항목 1}
- Korean text accuracy: {체크항목 2}
- Korean text accuracy: {체크항목 3}
- Korean text accuracy: {체크항목 4}
- Korean text accuracy: {하단 문구}
